Adapted randomForestSRC portions
--------------------------------

Portions of the following files were adapted from the randomForestSRC
package and subsequently modified for multiRF:

  * src/mv_forest.cpp: RfsrcRan1, lcg_next, the swap-with-last sampling
    helpers, RF-SRC-compatible seed construction, and the associated
    supervised-forest draw sequence;
  * R/mrf3-util.R: portions of get_tree_net() that decode RF-SRC
    nativeArray tree records and map split-variable identifiers.

The corresponding randomForestSRC 3.5.1 source is principally found in
src/random.c, src/bootstrap.c, and R/get.tree.rfsrc.R. Version 3.5.1 was the
current CRAN release when these portions were adapted in March 2026.

